# ======================================================
# LexaGuide AI Recommendation Service - Env Template
# ======================================================
# 1) Copy this file to .env
# 2) The DB can be the SAME Atlas cluster as the backend
#    so both services share lawyers, templates, etc.
# ======================================================

# MongoDB connection
# ---- Local ----
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/Lexa
# ---- Atlas ----
# MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<pass>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/LexaGuide?retryWrites=true&w=majority

# Database name (should match what the backend writes to!)
DATABASE_NAME=Lexa
